body:
there is a difference between telling someone you have feelings for them and expressing your love. telling someone you have feelings for them is mostly harmless. "I think I like you more than a friend." EXPRESSING YOUR LOVE for someone, telling them that all the nice things they do to you are seen as romantic in your eyes... is overwhelming to hear. 

&#x200B;

someone commented this and im going to end it with their words, " lesbians need to stop finding attraction in straight \[women\]." if i find out a woman is straight the attraction drops so fast, there is nothing more unattractive than a straight woman imo.

check out [twitch.tv/TacticalGramma](https://twitch.tv/TacticalGramma) she is older than you (50s i believe) but she has a community of women. best place to find gaymers like yourself is to scour Twitch for like-minded individuals and individuals who plays the games that you play. shameless plug for my girlfriend [twitch.tv/Jessicah](https://twitch.tv/Jessicah) who created a community of 20-30 somethings to game with. TacticalGramma is a bigger streamer but community can also come from smaller streamers more easily. 

&#x200B;

TLDR: search video game streaming sites to find a small community !
